
C-FOCAL,1969

01.01 C-TO RAISE  A+B*I  TO THE N POWER
01.02 E
01.05 S PI=3.14159
01.07 A ?A B N?,!
01.14 I (A) 1.2,1.3,1.2
01.20 S TH=FATN[FABS<B/A>]
01.30 I (A) 1.4,1.6,1.5
01.40 I (B) 1.41,1.41,1.43
01.41 S TH=PI+TH; G 2.1
01.43 S TH=PI-TH; G 2.1
01.50 I (B) 1.51,2.1,2.1
01.51 S TH=2*PI-TH; G 2.1
01.60 I (B) 1.63,7.1
01.61 S TH=PI/2; G 2.1
01.63 S TH=3*PI/2

02.10 S Z=FEXP[FLOG<FSQT(A^2+B^2)>*N]
02.20 S A=Z*FCOS(TH*N)
02.30 S B=Z*FSIN(TH*N)
02.40 T "(A+B*I)^N=",A," +",B,"*I",!!; G 1.02

07.10 T "THAT IS THE ORIGIN, 0+0*I!",!
07.20 G 1.02
*